<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\火事.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "火の粉.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\荒田火事美冬なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"A gunshot...?
{PAUSE ""}
　What was that? It came from where <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> went."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">That gunfire just now is clearly not from a hunting rifle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Probably a pistol―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">an outsider's.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm coming!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Amblygo.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事森.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone is walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Who...? That woman...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She isn't anyone from the settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A pistol in her hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Blood all over her face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She is walking slowly, sluggishly, as if she were dying.</STYLE><PG>
"............!
{PAUSE ""}
　I remember now...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\桃子血を浴びる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">That is, if I remember right, a woman named </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Why would the woman who worked at Primavera...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I see. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Erina Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">So </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spent 4 whole years on a plan like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But how did she ever find her way here?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone who lives in the everyday world could never get all the way here in the middle of the night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then one of the residents must have guided her...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is heading slowly, sluggishly, toward the settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What does she intend to do?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Could she be looking for me...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事森.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Who's there!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There's no one.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just now, I definitely heard someone's voice.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No, but I think I heard the voice from far off―from the direction of the settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At the very least, it can't have been </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Could it be a resident who didn't get out in time?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\荒田火事美冬なし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Momoko Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―making sure she doesn't notice me, I get ahead of her and head back to the settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It should have come from around here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Who? Who is it? In a place this hot...</STYLE><PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Over here, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>...!
{PAUSE ""}
　Thank goodness, you're safe!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But, you know, everyone has died."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> too, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> too, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Everyone, everyone has died."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Don't tell me <STYLE ID="3">Momoko Goto</STYLE>...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm grateful to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Because this settlement needs a great many corpses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Hey, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">that's why </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
you<STYLE ID="5"> too―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "300" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,111" "25" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"S-<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>!?
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Where did she go!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She has vanished, just like smoke.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Even when I look up at the sky, there is only fire roaring up into the heavens.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What does that mean...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A hallucination...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's it, it's a hallucination!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or I'm just dreaming!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\桃子銃逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-500" "C" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n300\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>What happened?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was I shot?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Momoko Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Not bad.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Am I being dragged?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Am I alive?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's impossible. I was shot in the head.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Could it have missed the vital spots?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But my eyes won't open.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My mind is hazy.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\洞窟内川.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Where am I?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">A damp smell.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A dark, oppressive space.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is this the underground storeroom?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But it's strangely big for that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下扉あく2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">An iron-barred door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I see, this is the place that was closed off because of the danger of cave-ins.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Why am I here?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No, wait! Am I alive!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I sit up and run both hands all over my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm breathing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My heart is beating.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My body is warm, too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"You're awake, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE>! What is the meaning of this!?
{PAUSE ""}
　I was shot, wasn't I...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hee hee, don't panic. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">More importantly, there's someone I want you to meet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Someone to meet... 
{PAUSE ""}
Right now, this isn't the time..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> ignores what I said and drops her gaze to her feet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has something at her feet, wrapped in red cloth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ能面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">On the face of that something, a Noh mask.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="5">, let me introduce you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Our goddess―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Lady Verde."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
