{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">At that grotesque sight, plain at a single glance, I cover my mouth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Under that Noh mask, the mummy of a human who seems to have died long, long ago.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The goddess, Verde―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This is our goddess...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't be afraid, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="5"> are qualified to be a </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しんし">divine messenger</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">As a living first generation."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"That's right, </STYLE>Mifuyu-chan<STYLE ID="9">. </STYLE>
