<BR>
"Goddess... 
{PAUSE ""}
Verde... 
{PAUSE ""}
sama. 
{PAUSE ""}
My name is... 
{PAUSE ""}
Mifuyu Niimura."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I bow deeply to the motionless mummy.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The one thing I can say.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was a strange attachment to the mummy called the goddess.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
